  "details": "Please publish the release notes for VRChat 2026.3.2 (OPEN BETA) (`Build 1901`), 1 or 2 September 2026 on the VRChat Creation website.\n\nExpected URL: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202632-open-beta (?)\n\nActual behavior: The release notes only go as far as `Build 1898` (25 August 2026) at the bottom of the page.\n\nConfusingly, the Live branch also goes only up to `Build 1891` released on September 1, 206, which is less than the Open Beta version that's been live for longer.\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202632",
